  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Category:</strong> Luxury<br>\n<strong>Fabrication:</strong> DV29 - 5,000eb - 1 Month<br>\n<strong>Eligible:</strong> All Non-Explosive Smart Weapons</p>\n<p>Land a random Critical Injury - not a called shot like a Leg Aimed Shot - on a target with a Neuroport and the user picks one DV6 or DV8 Quickhack to fire into them, Netrunner or not. Do it on an Aimed Shot and the pick widens to DV6, DV8 or DV10. The Quickhack's effect and damage land separately from the Critical Injury and its bonus damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Iconic: it can't be bought or sourced on the street, can't be fabricated without its Blueprint, can't be taken during Character Generation, and once acquired can't be destroyed unless the player agrees to it beforehand.</li>\n<li>The price is the Luxury benchmark, for working out repairs and Tech Upgrades. Iconics can't be bought.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Becoming Iconic &gt; Iconic Weapons).</em></p>"
